  worldIndex: 7
  identityId: last_hour
  displayName: The Last Hour
  subtitle: The end of times, looped until even endings are tired.
  biomeTags: 0800000001000000
  paletteHint: eclipse black, pale brass, smoke blue, dying crimson
  lightingHint: long sunset with stars visible through the floor
  materialNotes: broken clocks, meteor dust, glass sand, burnt paper
  prologueLine: The final hour has struck so often it has gone hoarse.
  branchLine: Branches count down to doors that refuse to stay closed.
  hubLine: The anchor is a minute hand nailed to nothing.
  bossLine: The warden waits at the second before everything stops.
  extractionLine: The hour breaks. Another hour crawls out underneath.
  branchEchoNames:
  - Eclipse Dial
  - Meteor Choir
  - Ash Calendar
  - Zero Bell
